/E (These trainings laid a strong foundation for competence, compliance, and innovation. Early sessions addressed estimating gaps, strengthened pre-tender discipline, and improved pricing capability. Members gained practical tools to ensure sustainable growth and demonstrated their commitment to professionalism and excellence.)
/Pg 11 0 R
