109 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 64 0 R
/E (However, challenges remain. Many contractors still struggle to interpret and administer standard contract forms \(JBCC, GCC, FIDIC\), leading to lost entitlements, weak claims, and margin erosion during execution. Addressing this gap is our next priority, ensuring contractors can protect their rights and revenues throughout the project lifecycle.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
